# The desktop's budgets on the Orange Pi 6 Plus, for drive(1): a fresh
# boot of the board's desktop image (esp-board-desktop) at 1920x1080, in
# whichever theme is in force (Radharc's status names it, and the budgets
# carry its name), with no prompt waiting (chords' grant saved on /data).
# master-stack puts rc's window at (32, 32) under the console's (40, 60):
# the strip of it left of the console, x 32-39, takes the click.
#
#   vx cpu -r docs/boards/orangepi-6-plus -c 'drive /mnt/term/root/desktop-budgets.drive' 192.168.0.19
#
# then, for ui.compose_cpu.1080p, from the same cpu session:
#   echo start compose-cpu >/svc/launcher/ctl; sleep 5; log | grep budget
mark rc's window focused
click 35 200
settle
mark terminal.key_draw and key_glass: ten keys in rc's window
keydraw 10
mark desktop.cold_start: minimal, three times (it draws 30 frames and quits)
coldstart minimal
wait 2000
coldstart minimal
wait 2000
coldstart minimal
